# Files to ignore
*.DS*
Rplots.pdf
tmp/
*.csv
literature/*.pdf
# Word files are build artifacts, not sources -- the .qmd is the source of truth and
# regenerates them via `quarto render <file>.qmd --to docx`.
# ONE deliberate exception is force-added: phase1/reports/catf-reference.docx. It is a
# render INPUT (the `reference-doc:` template for key_insights.qmd), and key_insights is
# in the site render list, so the full `quarto render` FAILS without it on a fresh clone.
# Verified by direct test. Do not untrack it.
*.docx
*project_overview.md
20181101_COMMS_CATFBrandGuide.pdf
project_overview.md
*running_todo.md
*running_todo.html
.claude/
.codex/
notes/timeline/Refactor Architecture.md
*advice.txt
Refactor Architecture*
scratch.R

